          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe malayke sleémeero a qeeru. Inooín kaa ya/aáw nee Mungú as mukdá' ba/ama ga sláw nguwa sagadiyuusiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.14",
